# Omicron

++Y$}Web Builder++ !!)PK#Omicron# is a visual builder for laying out web pages, making templates and producing HTML. Its ribbon works like Microsoft Sway, with cards, styles, tags and skills!

[Open Omicron](/omicron) · [Phone version](/omicron/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Omicron|pink}
## What you can do

* ++C@@Position elements++ visually, and use templates to start quickly!
* ++G%)Export++ a page as a website ZIP, or as a single HTML file with every style built in!
* #/O$Insert Bitbook notes$ into a page!

## BitLang in pages

Omicron includes the same BitLang engine as Bitbook, so small programs can run inside pages you build. See [BitLang](#/bitlang)!
